Package: CSSD
Title: Dataset Creator for CBS Microdata
Version: 0.0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Max", "Maes", , "maxmaes2004@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simplifies the process of working with CBS (Centraal Bureau voor Statistiek) 
    microdata by providing a prepackaged core dataset which (mostly) conforms to the 
    EU Standardised key social variables as well as some utility functions.
